Feature: Secret rotation
  One recipe replaces an application's secret in the store with a value it makes itself, has the Secret refreshed, waits for the restart, and proves from digests that every pod is a new one that holds the new value and that none holds the value from before; a list in the tree says how each key the tree reads from the store is rotated, and the recipe rotates only a key that any new random value will do for.

